    {
      "record_type": "ai_exercise",
      "exercise_id": "ai_e166f8247553c0de",
      "topic": "给我几道SQL题目练习",
      "type": "choice",
      "difficulty": "intermediate",
      "question": "假设有\"employees\"表和\"departments\"表，分别包含员工信息和部门信息，以下哪条语句可以查询所有员工及其对应的部门名称？",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "SELECT employees.name, departments.name FROM employees, departments WHERE employees.dept_id = departments.id;"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "SELECT employees.name, departments.name FROM employees JOIN departments ON employees.dept_id = departments.id;"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "SELECT employees.name, departments.name FROM employees INNER JOIN departments ON employees.dept_id = departments.id;"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "以上都可以"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "explanation": "选项A使用隐式连接语法，选项B和C使用显式连接语法，INNER JOIN可以省略INNER关键字，所有选项都是正确的连接方式。",
      "user_answer": "B",
      "correct": false,
      "attempts": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-08-14T17:50:01",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-14T17:50:01"
